      "text": "watchdog 只做「替 GitHub 按一下按钮」\n不参与任何内容生成；它只被 cron 叫醒\n两条链路各自 push（共用 concurrency group）",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "legNote",
      "originalText": "watchdog 只做「替 GitHub 按一下按钮」\n不参与任何内容生成；它只被 cron 叫醒\n两条链路各自 push（共用 concurrency group）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
